{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ANQWDx9GgM1793157075.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>俄羅斯及烏克蘭在奧列什基地區提早執行停火協議，烏方強調已準備好，參加烏美俄三方會談。</p><p></p><p>在烏克蘭南部赫爾松地區，部分建築物在戰火下倒塌。有居民稱近日市面很平靜，甚至有點不尋常，並質疑烏俄雙方未必全面落實停火協議，不排除趁機補給彈藥物資。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UKR.CEASEFIRE-0701_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026UiN44tIwaz1793151455.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有份斡旋的美國第一夫人梅拉尼亞指停火協議已在周二生效，比原定計劃提早兩天，範圍更擴大到赫爾松州、奧列什基以外地區，為救援車隊提供安全通道。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UKR.CEASEFIRE-0701.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026B4jyhMK6KM1793151460.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>烏克蘭外長瑟比加稱，烏方準備到阿聯酋與美國及俄羅斯舉行三方會談。他又稱烏方願意接受部分停火及全面停止敵對行動，但必須有公平及公正解決方案。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:52.531279+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:58:10.711651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:26.381284+00:00","content_hash":"8d5008286cb6121fd906df77a5aba11635e8c98d5f871e8643c9a4c59f8f18cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:52.531279+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}